67296207139.jpeg/dhCHlRRhCK4CGhai8zzSFotJGzuc-YQYnYZIhp2GSIY\"/><figcaption>更多張啟樂的照片（張啟樂Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"更多張啟樂的照片（張啟樂Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230117/692003979416047616437102.jpeg/Y6RvEzgCrnTM4YC43GfXKYz6rv5S_W2Tp4HCIKeBwiA\"/><figcaption>更多張啟樂的照片（張啟樂Facebook）</figcaption></figure><p>至於另一位市長參選人沈伯洋，張啟樂則笑言對方給自己最深印象是「好fashion」，形容其造型好看、時尚並帶點文青味道，甚至建議大眾可參考其穿搭；他表示，外表形象同樣重要，坦言目前頗欣賞其打扮，但對其政見內容則尚未深入認識。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:15:39.581740+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1756,"images":18,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T08:00:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T10:51:15.271052+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:09:15.597014+00:00","content_hash":"85b4616a82c11604a182f9816654aadc76f216f1fd00e895c966210388e58670","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}